Aerospec1: Crit and damage bonus doubled
Marnite1: Increased damage and range of lasers, placement bonuses doubled
DesertProwler1: Stronger jumps, increased knockback and damage
Wulfrum1: Scanned enemies take even more extra damage from debuffs
Hydrothermic1: Overheat lasts for longer, damage reduction increased to 45%, flare damage increased
Daedalus1: Increased arrow damage, amount and speed
SnowRuffian1: Increased wing strength
Reaver1: Defense, life regen, and movement speed bonuses doubled, increased Reaver Rage duration
Plaguebringer1: Plague cloud deals more damage and charges from longer away
PlagueReaper1:
	'''
	Debuffs spread from farther 
	Enemies spread debuffs for a longer amount of time
	'''
Umbraphile1: Bats deal more damage and heal for more
Sulphur1: Jumps create 3 bubbles
Victide1: Spikes are no longer affected by gravity and inflict venom
Statigel1: Higher maximum speed, damage bonus doubled
TitanHeart1: Doubled damage reduction, increased grounded charge rate to 100% total
FathomSwarmer1: Larger Light, Faster Fish
Astral1: Longer trail, more damage
Brimflame1: Consumes only half of your defense, but still retains effect of all of your defense
Mollusk1: More damage, More immunity frames
Empyrean1: Increases damage, healing, and rage generation
LunicCorps: Doubles maximum shield durability
Tarragon: Immunity happens after 40 hits, and lasts twice as long
Prismatic: All projectiles are reflected, but light-based ones deal more damage
Bloodflare: Souls deal 400 damage, and 4 more are fired
OmegaBlue: Tentacles have increased range and aggression
GodSlayer: Darts deal 400 damage, and 4 more are fired
Fearmonger: Increases summon damage by 50%
Silva:
	'''
	Cooldown is reduced to 3 minutes. Can decrement when bosses are alive, but takes 5 minutes
	Silva revive recovers 5% health
	'''
AuricTesla: Increased damage and distance
Demonshade: Summons 3 red devils and doubles their health and damage
GemTech: Each gem's cooldown is halved, and most bonuses are increased
Intergelactic: Adds 2 more astroid belts, increases damage
SlipperyShogun: Tendrils start faster and inflict Fusion Burn
Geothermic: Doubles debris launched, inflicts Mechanical Trauma
SteamKnight: Increases steam distance, inflicts Brimstone Flames
Acropolis: Increases steam distance and debris amounts, inflicts Mechanical Trauma and Brimstone Flames
Marivinium: Adds a third shield
Anarchal: Doubles cell damage
Nihilplasmic: Doubles maximum shield durability
Smoldering: Doubles damage
EntropicFaquir: Doubles wraith damage
Sailfish: Increased damage boost
